# LifeLink Backend Environment Variables

# Supabase Postgres Connection String
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option A: Connection Pooler (Recommended - works across IPv4, IPv6, and serverless)
# Find in Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> Database -> Connection Pooling -> Session mode
# Format: postgresql+asyncpg://postgres.[PROJECT_REF]:[PASSWORD]@aws-0-[REGION].pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres
#
# Option B: Direct Connection (Requires IPv6 or Supabase IPv4 Add-on)
# Find in Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> Database -> Connection string -> URI
# Format: postgresql+asyncpg://postgres:[PASSWORD]@db.[PROJECT_REF].supabase.co:5432/postgres
#
# Note: You can paste standard 'postgresql://' or 'postgresql+asyncpg://' URLs; the backend 
# automatically converts the driver prefix and configures asyncpg SSL handling.
SUPABASE_DB_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://postgres.YOUR_PROJECT_REF:YOUR_PASSWORD@aws-0-ap-south-1.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres
